+config MMCSD_READ_MULTIBLOCK_LIMIT
+	int "Maximum block count per SDIO read transfer"
+	default 0
+	range 0 2147483647
+	depends on MMCSD_SDIO
+	---help---
+		Optionally impose a stricter limit on SDIO read transfers without
+		reducing the write transfer limit. Zero uses MMCSD_MULTIBLOCK_LIMIT.
+		A positive value is capped by MMCSD_MULTIBLOCK_LIMIT when that
+		global limit is nonzero. Set this to 1 for controllers that support
+		multiple-block writes but require single-block reads.
+		Explicit multi-block read ioctls exceeding this limit are rejected.
 
